# The raw record streams are NOT committed, following the M7/M8 convention:
# no raw measurement data is versioned, and every verifier recomputes from
# frozen seeds instead (see experiments/m7/verify_G15.js, experiments/m8/data).
#
# What IS committed is sufficient to reproduce and validate them exactly:
#   candidates.jsonl   every one of the 2000 candidates with its disposition
#   manifest.json      per-run fingerprint, diagnostics, digests and the
#                      pre-declared D-006 sufficiency counts
#   INTEGRITY.sha256   digests of all artifacts + the regeneration command
#
# Regenerate with:  cd experiments/q1 && node run_collection.js
transitions.jsonl
boundaries.jsonl
